# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# CYPHER65 · WAR ROOM · Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# NEVER commit .env to version control. It's in .gitignore.

# ── Bitcoin ──
# Your Bitcoin wallet address monitored by Parasite Pool
BTC_ADDRESS=bc1qpc3832jcu6m8qpqjvz5lkuydwjzv8v5vq5t5rs

# Your primary worker name (must match what Parasite.space reports)
WORKER_NAME=cypher65

# ── Server ──
# HTTP port to listen on (default: 8765)
PORT=8765

# Polling interval in seconds (default: 15)
POLL_INTERVAL=15

# ── Rate Limiting ──
# Max requests per minute per IP for API endpoints (default: 60)
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60

# ── Security ──
# Flask secret key for session/CSRF (generate with: python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))")
# If unset, a random key is generated on each restart (invalidates sessions).
SECRET_KEY=

# ── MiningRigRentals (MRR) API Credentials ──────────────────
# REQUIRED for MRR market data in Opportunity Engine + Solo Mining Advisor.
# Get your API key + secret at: https://www.miningrigrentals.com/account/api
# Format: API Key = your public key, API Secret = your HMAC-SHA1 signing key
# When set, the Opportunity Engine will include MRR deals in scan results.
# Without these, MRR shows as "credentials required" in tools/cli.
MRR_API_KEY=
MRR_API_SECRET=

# ── Webhook (optional) ──
# Discord/Telegram webhook URL for alerts. Can also be set via Settings UI.
# WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...
